{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Complex analytical and reasoning workflows are frequently error-prone when performed by a single monolithic model. Decomposing problems into specialized roles—such as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Planner"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyst"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Critic"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":"—drastically improves reasoning accuracy, reduces hallucinations, and permits parallelized tool execution.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiftAgent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides ","type":"text"},{"code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AgentMessageBus","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a reactive multi-agent framework built on Swift’s structured concurrency primitives (","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Architectural Topology","anchor":"Architectural-Topology","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["                         ┌───────────────────────┐","                         │   User \/ Prompt Task  │","                         └───────────┬───────────┘","                                     │","                                     ▼","                       ┌───────────────────────────┐","                       │      AgentMessageBus      │","                       │       (AsyncStream)       │","                       └─────────────┬─────────────┘","                                     │ Broadcasts","         ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐","         ▼                           ▼                           ▼","┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐","│     Planner      │       │     Analyst      │       │      Critic      │","│ Decomposes steps │       │ Queries & Models │       │ Validates logic  │","└────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘","         │                          │                          │","         └──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┘","                                    │ Parallel Tool Calls","                                    ▼","                     ┌─────────────────────────────┐","                     │ MultiAgentOrchestrator      │","                     │ withTaskGroup Tool Executor │","                     └──────────────┬──────────────┘","                                    │","               ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐","               ▼                                         ▼","      DataFrame Query Tool                      Statistical Model Tool"]},{"text":"Parallel Tool Calling","anchor":"Parallel-Tool-Calling","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When an agent requests multiple tool executions in a single reasoning step (e.g. computing standard deviations across three columns concurrently), "},{"code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator.executeToolsInParallel(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" executes them simultaneously across available CPU cores using "},{"code":"withTaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This reduces total latency from $\\sum_{i=1}^M T_i$ to $\\max_{i} T_i$."}]},{"text":"Example Usage","anchor":"Example-Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","\/\/ 1. Initialize orchestrator and message bus","let orchestrator = MultiAgentOrchestrato